        "richtext_9B4K8T": {
          "type": "richtext",
          "settings": {
            "text": "<p>The 1983 World Cup Edition is a carefully composed visual archive of the victory that introduced belief to Indian cricket.<\/p><p>At its centre stands the iconic <strong>1983 World Cup trophy<\/strong>, embossed with special treatment and elevated as the defining symbol of the moment that changed everything.<\/p><p>Surrounding it is a structured visual composition capturing the faces, moments, and emotion of that historic journey. From underdogs to champions. From uncertainty to dominance.<\/p><p>The year <strong>1983<\/strong> stands boldly at the top, marking the moment Indian cricket stepped into a new era.<\/p><p>This artwork honours the spark that ignited belief and shaped the foundation of what Indian cricket has become.<\/p>",
            "position": "bottom_left"
          }
        }
      },
